## 16. Design Patterns

### Singleton (thread-safe, enum)
```java
public enum Singleton {
    INSTANCE;
    public void doWork() { }
}

// Double-checked locking
class Config {
    private static volatile Config instance;
    private Config() { }
    static Config getInstance() {
        if (instance == null) {
            synchronized (Config.class) {
                if (instance == null) instance = new Config();
            }
        }
        return instance;
    }
}
```

